,{"children":"No. Our chapter has athletes, business guys, engineers, gym rats, DJs, bookworms, and everything in between. The main thing is whether you fit with the brotherhood."}]]}]}],["$","$L9","How much does it cost?",{"delay":0.12,"children":["$","details",null,{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"How much does it cost?"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Dues depend on the semester and what is planned. If you rush, we will walk you through the current cost clearly before you make any decision."}]]}]}],["$","$L9","What is the time commitment?",{"delay":0.16,"children":["$","details",null,{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"What is the time commitment?"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"During rush, it is mostly showing up to events and meeting the guys. Once you join, expect chapter, brotherhood events, philanthropy, and whatever else you choose to get involved in."}]]}]}],["$","$L9","What makes Pi Kapp different?",{"delay":0.2,"children":["$","details",null,{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"What makes Pi Kapp different?"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Pi Kapp at ASU is not trying to be like every other chapter on campus. We’re building the standard. The guys, the events, the philanthropy, the campus presence, and the way we carry ourselves all speak for themselves. Nationally, Pi Kapp already has the tradition. At ASU, we’re making it clear why this chapter is one of the strongest in the country."}]]}]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"final-cta px-5 pb-32 md:px-6 md:pb-36","children":["$","$L9",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-6xl border-t border-white/10 pt-10 md:pt-14","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-kicker","children":"Theta Xi · Arizona State"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-end","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"section-title max-w-3xl","children":"Ready to see 